### Animate dynamic InstancedMesh transforms and colors

Source: https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/blob/dev/examples/webgl_instancing_dynamic.html

Sets up dynamic InstancedMesh rendering with THREE.DynamicDrawUsage, updates instance matrices and instance colors per frame, and animates color transitions using TWEEN.

```javascript
