### Recompute InstancedMesh Bounding Volumes

Source: https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/blob/dev/manual/pages/how-to-update-things.html

Call computeBoundingBox and computeBoundingSphere whenever instance transforms change via setMatrixAt. These properties ensure features like view frustum culling and ray casting function correctly.

```javascript
instancedMesh.computeBoundingBox();
instancedMesh.computeBoundingSphere();
```

